    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "After they had gone on, Mrs. Bussman commented on the workman's close resemblance to her husband and even suggested that he might be his brother.",
      "translation": "在他们继续往前走之后，Bussman 夫人评论说那个工人长得和她丈夫非常相像，甚至暗示说他可能就是他兄弟。",
      "startTime": 87.1,
      "endTime": 98.7,
      "analysis": {
