    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Franz poured scorn on the idea, pointing out that his brother had been killed in action during the war.",
      "translation": "Franz 对这种想法嗤之以鼻，指出他的兄弟在战争期间已经阵亡了。",
