    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Though Mrs. Bussman was fully acquainted with this story, she thought that there was a chance in a million that she might be right.",
      "translation": "虽然 Bussman 夫人非常熟悉这个故事，但她认为有百万分之一的可能性，她或许是对的。",
